  "ownership_class": "dreamco_owned",
  "purpose": "An extensible DreamCo taxonomy for human, AI-model, robotic, and combined capabilities. Categories are authored and governed by DreamCo; this registry is not an exhaustive claim that every possible capability has already been cataloged.",
